# Ruleset: Alibaba
#
# Expects a mainland policy.
#
# Commerce, payments, cloud, DingTalk, Amap and device fingerprint hosts. alicdn.com lives in Direct/CDNChina.list; Youku in Media/Youku.list. UC Browser and Quark hosts under ucweb.com, uc.cn and myquark.cn belong on the mainland path; Quark download hosts stay in Direct/Download.list. Security hosts taken by the reject layer are repaired in Rescue/Alibaba.list, and the anycast space the apps dial by address is in Geo/AlibabaCIDR.list.

